[title33][sentence]
Boy is this thing full.  Lets see:  Freighter Commander
(with Secret Cargo mission disks); Kryniktorfsptlandia;
F-98 III; CEO's reQuest; SimIntestine; Balance of the Checkbook;
Ultimate Roman Numeral; Super Scribbleit (on eight-inch disks);
DeskMole; Squarebert; Breast Quest XXIV; an OS-2 hint book.
There must be two dozen titles in here.
